//>   staying a while
//>   leaving garden
//>   in attic
//>   too dusty, going back
//>   leaving attic
//> 3. a loop drops each turn's variable at the end of the turn
//>   turn 1
//>   leaving loop room
//>   turn 2
//>   leaving loop room
//> 4. an object's own destructor runs, then its fields are dropped
//>   house built
//>   closing up 1 Main St
//>   leaving kitchen
//>   leaving hall
//> 5. a moved object is dropped by its new owner, only once
//>   moved
//> 6. made: parts first, then the object
//>   lamp made, on: true
//>   desk made
//>   desk in use
//>   lamp dropped
//> 7. a link points at a room without owning it
//>   the last room was the porch
//>   leaving porch
//>   is it still there? false
//> end of main
//>   leaving kept
